# CODEOWNERS for LedgerLens-data
#
# Each line defines who must review PRs that touch the matching paths.
# Entries lower in the file take precedence over higher ones.
#
# Format:  <pattern>  <@team-or-user> [<@team-or-user> ...]
#
# Teams are defined in the Ledger-Lenz GitHub org:
#   @Ledger-Lenz/data-core       – ingestion & feature pipeline leads
#   @Ledger-Lenz/ml-core         – model training, inference, drift
#   @Ledger-Lenz/security        – auth, DP, adversarial, cryptography
#   @Ledger-Lenz/infra           – CI/CD, Docker, Kafka, monitoring
#   @Ledger-Lenz/contracts       – Soroban / smart contract integration
#   @Ledger-Lenz/maintainers     – catch-all; fallback reviewers

# ─── Catch-all (lowest precedence) ────────────────────────────────────────────
*                                       @Ledger-Lenz/maintainers

